Since I'm posting anwyay, let me tell you a cute little trick I found with
my Wand of Polymorph and Spellbooks. Since you can read Spllbooks lots of
times now, you are open to a neat little operation. After reading the
Spellbook, you can then zap it with thewand and get another Spellbook. I
had two books of Light. I also had a Wand of Polymorph with 7 charges. I
read the spell and zapped both books. They both polymorph into a different
spellbook. If you like the book, you keep one and just continue zapping the
ook and keep reading before you zap it. I came out with 8 spells from that
little trick. Yeah, one can use the wand for better things, but I thought
it was a cute little trick.

